&lt;h2 id="source-code-analysis"&gt;Source code analysis&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The script implements the AKS primality test, and asks for a prime number that has a factor different than $1$ and the same number:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Web3</title><link>https://7rocky.github.io/en/ctf/other/balsn-ctf/web3/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://7rocky.github.io/en/ctf/other/balsn-ctf/web3/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;We are given a Node.js application that uses Web3:&lt;/p&gt;
 &lt;div class="code-container" style="position: relative;"&gt;
 &lt;div class="highlight" data-pagefind-ignore="all"&gt;
